{{!
    @template enrol_apply/review_applicant

    The applicant's card, the right column: the picture centred, the name under it, "Applicant",
    the identity fields this reader may see (label over value, no frame of their own), and the
    full profile where core would open it. No contact buttons.

    The picture is decoration beside the name, rendered by core without a link and with an empty
    alternative text, and triple stashed because it is core's own markup. Reading order is left
    column first, so a screen reader meets the applicant's name in the breadcrumb and the page
    title before it reaches this card.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * picture string - core's user_picture() markup, triple stashed
    * applicantname string - the applicant's full name, plain spelling
    * applicantrole string - "Applicant"
    * hasidentity boolean - whether this reader may see any identifying detail of the applicant
    * identity array - one entry per identity field the site named and this reader may see, each
      carrying a label and a value, both in the PLAIN spelling; the e-mail address is one of
      these when showuseridentity names it and absent when it does not
    * hasprofile boolean - whether user/view.php would open the applicant's profile for this reader
    * profileurl string - the applicant's profile in this course, empty without hasprofile
    * profilelabel string - the link's text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "picture": "<img class=\"userpicture\" src=\"https://example.com/pix/u/f1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">",
        "applicantname": "Ana Souza",
        "applicantrole": "Applicant",
        "hasidentity": true,
        "identity": [
            {"label": "Email address", "value": "ana@example.org"},
            {"label": "ID number", "value": "2026-0071"}
        ],
        "hasprofile": true,
        "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/view.php?id=5&course=7",
        "profilelabel": "View full profile"
    }
}}
<section class="enrol_apply-applicantcard enrol_apply-box" aria-labelledby="enrol_apply_applicant_name">
    <div class="enrol_apply-applicanthead">
        <span class="enrol_apply-applicantavatar">{{{picture}}}</span>
        <h2 class="enrol_apply-applicantcardname" id="enrol_apply_applicant_name">{{applicantname}}</h2>
        <div class="enrol_apply-applicantrole">{{applicantrole}}</div>
    </div>
    {{#hasidentity}}
        <dl class="enrol_apply-identity enrol_apply-profilefacts">
            {{#identity}}
                <div><dt>{{label}}</dt><dd>{{value}}</dd></div>
            {{/identity}}
        </dl>
    {{/hasidentity}}
    {{#hasprofile}}<a class="btn enrol_apply-profilebutton" href="{{profileurl}}">{{profilelabel}}</a>{{/hasprofile}}
</section>
